# Butler Routes - Mulgore rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 9 rare-flagged NPCs of Mulgore
# (zone key 1412), verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever npc/object/item dumps). Every goal is optional - a
# missing spawn never wedges the guide. Six carry the data's rare
# role; three (Ukta, Igleg, Snarlsnout) are rank-4 elites with no
# rare role but eponymous exclusive drops, and ship with that caveat
# stated (see docs/mulgore-companions-inventory.md). Multi-point
# rares loop all their points; single-point rares get plain
# single-goto steps. Mazzranache carries the zone's only tame line
# (plainstrider parts on its table plus a contracted core quest that
# kills plainstriders). Treasures ride one loop over the 24 fixed
# Battered Chest points plus a single-goto step for the Dirt-stained
# Map (which starts uncontracted quest 781 - noted, never accepted).
# No accept/turnin lines anywhere - the core guide owns every quest.
guide butler-routes-completionist/mulgore-rares
title Mulgore - Rares & Treasures
levels 1-13
zone Mulgore
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords mulgore, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step The wilds - Ghost Howl

  zone map 1412

  loop
  goto 34.7,34.23
  goto 47.11,47.75
  goto 46.7,25.48
  kill 3056 optional
  collect 4854 "Demon Scarred Cloak" optional
  note Ghost Howl (level 12 rare elite) roams the mesa country west, central and east of Thunder Bluff. The cloak drops every kill and drops nowhere else.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Stringy Wolf Meat, rabbit feet, Shadowgem); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ravaged Caravan wreck - Mazzranache

  zone map 1412

  goto 49.07,48.71
  kill 3068 optional
  task "Tame it instead of killing it" optional only Hunter
  collect 4861 "Sleek Feathered Tunic" optional
  note Mazzranache (level 9 rare elite) stands by the Ravaged Caravan wreck ground east of Bloodhoof. The tunic drops here and nowhere else.
  note A tallstrider: hunters may tame rather than kill. Also drops plainstrider parts and ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step West of Thunder Bluff - Sister Hatelash

  zone map 1412

  goto 37.24,22.6
  kill 5785 optional
  collect 4772 "Warm Cloak" optional
  note Sister Hatelash (level 11 rare) holds a single point west of Thunder Bluff. The cloak drops here and nowhere else.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Linen Cloth, Light Feather); respawn timer unconfirmed.

step The southern plains - Snagglespear

  zone map 1412

  loop
  goto 47.42,73.29
  goto 51.7,74.28
  kill 5786 optional
  note Snagglespear (level 9 rare elite) walks two points on the southern plains. No unique loot recorded - ordinary greens and generic world-drop patterns only.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Thunder Bluff base - Enforcer Emilgund

  zone map 1412

  goto 40.75,26.26
  kill 5787 optional
  collect 284361 "Venture Company Legguards" optional
  note Enforcer Emilgund (level 11 rare elite) holds a single point at the Thunder Bluff base. The legguards drop here and nowhere else.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Linen Cloth, Slitherskin Mackerel); respawn timer unconfirmed.

