  collect 17922 "Lionfur Armor" optional
  note The Rake (level 10 rare elite) holds a single point on the eastern plain. The armor drops every kill and drops nowhere else.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (Discolored Fang, Small Leather Collar); respawn timer unconfirmed.

