step Thornmantle camp - Dirt-stained Map

  zone map 1412

  goto 59.8,82.2
  interact 3076 optional
  note The Dirt-stained Map at the Thornmantle camp always yields item 4851, which starts quest 781 Attack on Camp Narache. That quest is in no guide and no contract (census gap, see the inventory) - noted here, never accepted here.
